flowchart TD
    Start((Task Execution)) --> CheckNull{components<br>valid?}

    CheckNull -->|no| LogNull[Log: Component NULL]
    LogNull --> DelayNull[Delay 100ms]
    DelayNull --> Loop((Continue Loop))

    CheckNull -->|yes| TryOperation[Try operation]

    TryOperation --> CheckSuccess{operation<br>success?}

    CheckSuccess -->|yes| UpdateState[Update state]
    CheckSuccess -->|no| LogError[Log error message]

    UpdateState --> CheckMutex{need<br>mutex?}
    CheckMutex -->|yes| TryMutex[Try mutex take 100ms]
    CheckMutex -->|no| SignalSem

    TryMutex --> MutexSuccess{mutex<br>acquired?}
    MutexSuccess -->|yes| CriticalSection[Execute critical section]
    MutexSuccess -->|no| LogMutexTimeout[Log: Mutex timeout]
    LogMutexTimeout --> SignalSem

    CriticalSection --> GiveMutex[Give mutex]
    GiveMutex --> SignalSem[Signal semaphore]

    LogError --> CheckRecover{recover<br>possible?}

    CheckRecover -->|yes| Recover[Recover operation]
    CheckRecover -->|no| Fallback[Fallback to safe state]

    Recover --> UpdateState
    Fallback --> SignalSem

    SignalSem --> CheckReport{error<br>rate<br>high?}

    CheckReport -->|yes| IncrementError[Increment error counter]
    CheckReport -->|no| Check10s{10s<br>elapsed?}

    IncrementError --> CheckThreshold{error<br>count<br>>10?}

    CheckThreshold -->|yes| LogCritical[Log: Critical error rate]
    CheckThreshold -->|no| Check10s

    LogCritical --> ResetCounter[Reset error counter]
    ResetCounter --> Check10s

    Check10s -->|yes| ResetCounter
    Check10s -->|no| Loop

    Loop --> Start

    note[Error Handling Strategy: 1 NULL pointer checks 2 Mutex timeout protection 3 Fallback to safe state 4 Error rate monitoring 5 Critical error logging]